      "id": 218,
      "options": {
        "content": "# 🏢 UniFi Location Platform (ULP) - Mars Observatory\n\n## 🔧 **Service Overview**\nThe **UniFi Location Platform (ULP) Go version 1.11.26** is running on mars, providing Ubiquiti's **Identity and Location Service** for indoor positioning and device management.\n\n## 🚀 **Main Components**\n### Core Services\n- **ulp-go-app** (PID 5831) - Main positioning service on **port 9443 (HTTPS)**\n- **unifi-user-assets-app** (PID 5733) - User assets service on **port 9780 (HTTP)**\n\n## 📊 **Current Activity**\n### Device Tracking (5 devices)\n- 📱 **2 MacBook Pro models** (M1 & Intel)\n- 💻 **1 MacBook Air M1**\n- 📱 **2 iPhones** (11 Pro & 15 Pro)\n\n### Location Management\n- 🏢 **1 building location** managed\n- 🆔 **UUID**: `dbc6e391-bc7a-4309-8cef-919b5c08694d`\n\n### API Services\n- 🔐 **Identity management** (`/api/v2/identity/*`)\n- 👤 **User management** (`/api/v2/user/*`)\n- 💼 **Workspace information**\n- 📍 **Location services**\n- 📱 **Device registration and tracking**\n\n## ⚙️ **Real-time Operations**\n- 🧹 **Location cleanup**: Automatic cleanup of deleted locations hourly\n- 🔐 **RADIUS provisioning**: WiFi user credentials updated every 5 minutes\n- 📱 **Device monitoring**: Continuous tracking of connected devices\n- 🆔 **Identity services**: User authentication and authorization management\n\n## 🏗️ **Technical Implementation**\n- 🗄️ **Database**: PostgreSQL backend with 65+ tables\n- 🏛️ **Architecture**: Golang-based microservices architecture\n- 🔒 **Security**: Encrypted database, SSL/TLS endpoints, device authentication\n- 🔗 **Integration**: Connected to UniFi Network Controller for WiFi positioning\n\n## 🔗 **Quick Links**\n- **ULP API Console**: [https://mars.int.bozza.au:9443](https://mars.int.bozza.au:9443)\n- **User Assets Service**: [http://mars.int.bozza.au:9780](http://mars.int.bozza.au:9780)\n- **Prometheus**: [http://192.168.22.253:9090](http://192.168.22.253:9090)\n- **Loki Logs**: Use the Explore tab → Loki data source\n\n## 📝 **Monitoring Notes**\n- **Service Health**: Monitor the \"ULP Services Status\" panel for service availability\n- **Device Tracking**: Real-time device position tracking via WiFi triangulation\n- **API Activity**: RESTful API usage for identity and location services\n- **Error Monitoring**: Watch the error panels for service issues\n\n---\n**🏢 Indoor Positioning API Service | 🚀 Deployed on Mars (192.168.22.1) | Built with ❤️ for Enterprise Location Analytics**",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "8.0.0",
      "title": "📋 ULP Service Documentation & Reference Guide",
      "type": "text"
    }
